"The Cookbook explains three actuators per segment: 61 x 3 = 183.&#10;The selected formal model composes all 183 actuators directly under the mirror.&#10;No actuator-to-individual-segment allocation is added by this simplification." source_id="" vertex="1" style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;"><mxGeometry x="132" y="644" width="948.0" height="81" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" parent="1" value="" source_id="" original_label="" edge="1" style="endArrow=none;startArrow=none;startFill=1;dashed=0;strokeColor=#616161;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="52" y="789" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1228" y="789" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" parent="1" value="Real APE instrument; professionally reverse-engineered and simplified MBSE reference, not an as-built model.&#10;Cookbook section 5.3.5 / Figure 10 (2011) and pinned model (2023): traced match, not an identical export.&#10;New layout omits source photographs and quantitative values; Apache-2.0 model notices preserved." source_id="" vertex="1" style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#555555;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;"><mxGeometry x="52" y="803" width="1036.8" height="69" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>